<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of November 18 to November 22, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreign investors have been net buyers for the past two consecutive weeks.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   401.94 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  395.81 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			   6.14 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying	13.33 billion yen</p>
